WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:04.947
♪ Am I weak ♪

00:00:04.947 --> 00:00:07.226
♪ Or am I just playing it cool ♪

00:00:07.226 --> 00:00:08.649
- [Governer] I don't see Dushane.

00:00:08.649 --> 00:00:09.940
- No, ma'am.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.420
He's been keeping an
extremely low profile.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.470
- Dushane's very cagey, guv'nor.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:16.210
No one even knows where he's living.

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.323
- Then we need to be
smarter then, don't we?

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.183
This guy shouldn't be on our streets.

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:26.974
(intense dance music)

00:00:26.974 --> 00:00:30.298
(tape reel rewinding)

00:00:30.298 --> 00:00:31.398
- Oh look, here we go.

00:00:32.454 --> 00:00:33.973
The zombies are back again.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.933
- Keep it down.

00:00:37.933 --> 00:00:39.713
I told you don't fucking come around here.

00:00:39.713 --> 00:00:41.800
- Can you just give us a hit, please?

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:42.680
- Where's your pea?

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.513
- He's got it.

00:00:47.345 --> 00:00:49.542
- That ain't no fucking money, man.

00:00:49.542 --> 00:00:50.630
- It's got Bluetooth.

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:52.100
- Everyone's got Bluetooth, cuz.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:54.320
My ancestors have got Bluetooth.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.590
Bring me something more interesting,

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:57.000
like an iPad or something.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.430
- Can we just get two white, please?

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:00.477
C'mon, man, it's worth two.
- Fuck off!

00:01:02.913 --> 00:01:04.960
- Don't even ask, I ain't
got fuck all for you.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.340
- No, listen, man.
- Didn't you hear me,

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:07.240
fuck off, man!
- I got something

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:09.185
to tell you, innit?
- What?

00:01:09.185 --> 00:01:11.795
- See that store where that
fella sells them lighters?

00:01:11.795 --> 00:01:12.628
- What about it?

00:01:12.628 --> 00:01:13.722
- He's police.

00:01:13.722 --> 00:01:14.615
- What?

00:01:14.615 --> 00:01:16.160
- We saw him.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:17.550
We seen him, didn't we?

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.520
At the cop shop, he's Old Bill.

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:21.044
- He'll nick us, innit?

00:01:21.044 --> 00:01:23.050
Said we was trying to
break into some house,

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:25.180
took his time throwing us into a nick.

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:26.013
They didn't have a thing on us, though,

00:01:26.013 --> 00:01:27.510
'cause we hadn't even
fucking broken in to it.

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:28.810
- We were sitting in the
corridor in the nick,

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:30.683
and who walks past but him?

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:32.480
- They probably nicked him and all.

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:34.710
- No, he was laughing and joking

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:35.890
with the other coppers.

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:37.750
Like they was all mates.

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:38.650
- His name's Dave.

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:42.443
- Dave, yeah?

00:01:42.443 --> 00:01:44.020
- That's what they were all calling him.

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.180
He's definitely a copper, man, trust me.

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:47.013
- Yeah, go on.

00:01:47.013 --> 00:01:47.846
Fuck off.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:51.780
- Looks like we've got a little spy.

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:53.267
- So what you wanna do?

00:01:56.827 --> 00:01:58.477
- Better go chat to this brother.

00:02:08.622 --> 00:02:09.877
The fuck do you lot want?

00:02:09.877 --> 00:02:10.820
- Can you give us a hit?

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:11.910
- There ain't no food.

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:14.060
- C'mon, man, please.

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:14.970
- Listen to what I'm saying.

00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:17.430
There ain't no fucking
food on the road right now.

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:19.441
- Even just like a little bit of weed?

00:02:19.441 --> 00:02:21.620
Everyone's always got weed.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:23.260
- We gave you the wink about

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:26.400
the undercover copper, didn't we?

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.030
- Go over there.

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:29.682
- So what, you lot got peas then?

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:32.570
- No, Woodrow said that
you'd tick us for it.

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:34.153
- Go, tick them for it.

00:02:38.245 --> 00:02:40.162
- Go on then, fuck off.

00:02:46.776 --> 00:02:47.963
- What the fuck's going on?

00:02:47.963 --> 00:02:49.240
Where's the others?

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:50.390
- They ain't showed up.

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:52.920
- Hey yo, yous two, come here.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:56.700
- Hey, get over here, man.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:57.533
- Listen.

00:02:57.533 --> 00:02:59.380
I know you lot trawl
round here a lot, innit.

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:02.600
Hey Farad, give them your number.

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.373
- [Farad] Bruv, pass your phone.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:12.940
- Listen, it's simple.

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:16.765
You see Deshane, you
see Sully, you shout me.

00:03:16.765 --> 00:03:18.200
Like I said, I got you.

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.520
- Yeah, all right.

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:24.367
- [Jamie] Ay yo, give
them something, innit.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:30.173
- Thank you.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:35.833
- Yo.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:40.573
- [Dealer] The fuck are you
gonna do with them, bruv?

00:03:43.699 --> 00:03:45.310
- [Junkie] Yeah?

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:46.710
- You lot wanna make some money, yeah?

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:47.867
- Yeah, of course.

00:03:47.867 --> 00:03:49.301
- We'll do anything.

00:03:49.301 --> 00:03:50.410
- All right, listen.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:51.600
Go down the fields, yeah?

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.950
Keep your eyes and your ears open.

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:56.610
Anything you see or you
hear about Jamie's supply,

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:57.443
you let me know.

00:03:58.455 --> 00:04:00.165
I got a hit for you.

00:04:00.165 --> 00:04:01.523
- We won't let you down, man.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:04.803
- What?

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:07.393
- Junkies, fam.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:09.423
Really?

00:04:10.684 --> 00:04:13.351
(ominous music)

00:04:17.583 --> 00:04:19.166
- Right, come here.

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:22.877
Right, come on, let's go.

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:28.032
Do you reckon that's all right?

00:04:28.032 --> 00:04:29.624
- No.

00:04:29.624 --> 00:04:30.681
- No, more?

00:04:30.681 --> 00:04:31.514
- Yeah.

00:04:36.873 --> 00:04:38.980
- It's fucking cold.

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.990
- How long we supposed to
hang around the fields?

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:42.220
- Until we see something
that we can give Dris.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:43.493
Something interesting.

00:04:43.493 --> 00:04:44.326
- Hopefully.

00:04:44.326 --> 00:04:45.159
- Shit.

00:04:45.159 --> 00:04:45.992
- [Passerby] What'd you say?

00:04:45.992 --> 00:04:46.924
- What?

00:04:46.924 --> 00:04:47.757
- What's up with you?

00:04:47.757 --> 00:04:48.736
- [Junkie] Nothing's up with me

00:04:48.736 --> 00:04:49.620
- What are you fucking
doing around here anyway,

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:50.616
you shouldn't be around here anyway,

00:04:50.616 --> 00:04:51.450
look at the state of the pair of you,

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:52.300
skanky pair of--
- Literally said

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:53.419
nothing to you.

00:04:53.419 --> 00:04:54.275
- [Junkie] You walked into her, bro.

00:04:54.275 --> 00:04:55.225
- Right bro, who you bro-ing?

00:04:55.225 --> 00:04:56.130
What's it gotta do with you?

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.344
- Look, calm down--
- Fuck off.

00:04:57.344 --> 00:04:58.511
- [Junkie] Oi!

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:02.573
- Listen, take your filthy junkie shit

00:05:02.573 --> 00:05:03.889
and stay off this estate.

00:05:03.889 --> 00:05:05.023
Do you understand me?

00:05:05.023 --> 00:05:05.954
There's kids in here, man--

00:05:05.954 --> 00:05:06.787
- Get off of him, leave him alone

00:05:06.787 --> 00:05:07.970
- Sling your fucking hook.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:08.970
- Just relax, Sarah!

00:05:11.192 --> 00:05:12.818
It's all right.

00:05:12.818 --> 00:05:13.760
Look, we're going, all right?

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:15.880
We're leaving, all right?

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.741
- Just so you understand,

00:05:17.741 --> 00:05:18.657
don't let me catch you round here again,

00:05:18.657 --> 00:05:21.340
and don't let my fucking kids
catch you around here again.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.602
Do you understand me?

00:05:22.602 --> 00:05:23.781
- I understand, mate.

00:05:23.781 --> 00:05:25.698
I'm going, we're going.

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:27.613
- Fuck off.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:35.603
- You all right?

00:05:37.016 --> 00:05:37.849
Oi?

00:05:39.019 --> 00:05:40.219
- I'm sick of this shit.

00:05:41.501 --> 00:05:42.334
- I know.

00:05:43.279 --> 00:05:44.112
Come on.

